  "text": "24 Hour Emergency Vet in Auburn Hills, MI | BluePearl Pet Hospital\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Auburn Hills, MI\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAuburn Hills, MI\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n248.371.3713\n3412 E Walton Blvd.\nAuburn Hills, MI 48326\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nMon-Thu: 8 am-5 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving the northern suburbs of Detroit 24/7.\nWe are located north of Detroit in Auburn Hills. Along with our sister pet hospital in Southfield, we serve pets throughout Bloomfield Hills, Pontiac, Rochester Hills, Troy, Flint, Oakland Township, Romeo, Utica, Macomb, Clinton Township, Clarkston and Waterford areas.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen you have a pet emergency, seconds count. We want you to know, we’re ready 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, 365 days a year—even holidays. If your pet has a condition that requires a specialist’s expertise, we’re ready for that too. Our experienced veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\n24-hour emergency vet\nEmergency: In an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty veterinary care\nSpecialty Care: Our veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Auburn Hills.\nNeed an emergency vet? BluePearl Auburn Hills is minutes from Interstate 75 near Oakland University. Our modern pet hospital is equipped with the technology needed to provide extra care for your pets when they need it. Our board-certified specialists can provide diagnostic imaging and CT scans. Our clinicians are also able to collaborate with our specialty services at Southfield to provide the care that your pet needs.\nPet owners\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n248.371.3713\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n248.371.3713\n248.371.3714\n3412 E Walton Blvd.\nAuburn Hills,\nMI                                    48326\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSouthfield, MI\n29080 Inkster Rd.\nSouthfield, MI 48034\n248.354.6640\n13.09 miles\nBluePearl Pet Neurology\nFarmington, MI\n33300 W 9 Mile Rd.\nFarmington, MI 48336\n248.516.1122\n17.22 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAnn Arbor, MI\n4126 Packard Rd.\nAnn Arbor, MI 48108\n734.971.8774\n38.97 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
